{"chapter": "cotangent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "09DF", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{A} \\to \\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{P}_\\bullet \\to \\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0008": "$n \\geq 0$", "MATH_0009": "\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-atiyah-extension}\n0 \\to\n\\Omega_{\\mathcal{P}_n/\\mathcal{A}} \\otimes_{\\mathcal{P}_n} \\mathcal{F} \\to\n\\mathcal{P}^1_{\\mathcal{P}_n/\\mathcal{A}}(\\mathcal{F}) \\to\n\\mathcal{F} \\to 0\n\\end{equation}", "MATH_0010": "$n$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{P}_\\bullet$", "MATH_0012": "$L\\pi_! : D(\\mathcal{P}_\\bullet) \\to D(\\mathcal{B})$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{P}_\\bullet \\to \\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0014": "\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-atiyah-general}\nL_{\\mathcal{B}/\\mathcal{A}} \\otimes_\\mathcal{B}^\\mathbf{L} \\mathcal{F} \\to\nL\\pi_!\\left(\\mathcal{P}^1_{\\mathcal{P}_\\bullet/\\mathcal{A}}(\\mathcal{F})\\right)\n\\to \\mathcal{F} \\to\nL_{\\mathcal{B}/\\mathcal{A}} \\otimes_\\mathcal{B}^\\mathbf{L} \\mathcal{F} [1]\n\\end{equation}", "MATH_0015": "$D(\\mathcal{B})$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-cotangent-complex}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{sites-modules-lemma-sequence-of-principal-parts}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{sites-modules-remark-functoriality-principal-parts}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{equation-atiyah-extension}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{sites-cohomology-section-simplicial-modules}", "REF_0006": "\\ref{sites-cohomology-remark-homology-augmentation}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:512dc62ed00fb7b887ef2d9278050a80c351c4c6644ac66736f8a9153590fdf1", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0e15bb3cd7d5dc0bd724b4fa096f165a91be40da1b0b4c5de2bcb3d18f6ee345", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a site. Let <MATH_0002> be a\nhomomorphism of sheaves of rings. Let <MATH_0003> be a\nsheaf of <MATH_0004>-modules. Let <MATH_0005>\nbe the standard resolution of <MATH_0006> over <MATH_0007>\n(Section <REF_0001>).\nFor every <MATH_0008> consider the extension of principal parts\n<MATH_0009>\nsee\nModules on Sites, Lemma <REF_0002>.\nThe functoriality of this construction\n(Modules on Sites, Remark\n<REF_0003>)\ntells us (<REF_0004>) is the degree <MATH_0010> part of\na short exact sequence of simplicial <MATH_0011>-modules\n(Cohomology on Sites, Section\n<REF_0005>).\nUsing the functor <MATH_0012>\nof Cohomology on Sites, Remark\n<REF_0006>\n(here we use that <MATH_0013> is a resolution)\nwe obtain a distinguished triangle\n<MATH_0014>\nin <MATH_0015>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0cfc02099ac2766c4f8d115af86a8a6de211481bfa17e3a260fe215529f2dcef", "unit_id": "tag:09DF:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "cotangent", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "09DF", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{A} \\to \\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{F} \\to\nL_{\\mathcal{B}/\\mathcal{A}} \\otimes_\\mathcal{B}^\\mathbf{L} \\mathcal{F}[1]$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{equation-atiyah-general}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-atiyah-class-general}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b7a1fb24893e1f5985285b7fe27eb3d0d61d463693280a239c17aa1d551096ea", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cd12b00b6e56a28e0390d374bd8af4c9433e6060b3fd32c49d967cd68888bb9a", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a homomorphism of sheaves of rings.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a sheaf of <MATH_0004>-modules.\nThe map <MATH_0005>\nin (<REF_0001>) is called the <TEXTITOPEN_0001>Atiyah class<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> of\n<MATH_0006>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c27844dab484d61f4f827f58520cfb9d3bf161a64301d2dee30198d7a9f3a47f", "unit_id": "tag:09DI:statement"}
